{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38453eab9d6cc20e4d5be401bc2dcb04ec06346851a3ccda723bbe2403b775ab", "ja": "（仕事が一段落したから、お茶でも入れるか……ん？\n給湯室に誰かいるみたいだな。あれは、紗代子？）", "zh": "（工作告一段落了，泡杯茶吧……嗯？茶水间好像有人。那是紗代子？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a4a38bebc8cb3de2698de6442a249874ccc204806fb4426bf31033fec57a53ad", "ja": "ぐす……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7957308443a97b0f8508f74db953c6ec30eee1c816d387a3f82422e426372452", "ja": "さ、紗代子！？\nどうしたんだ、ケガでもしたのか！？", "zh": "纱代子！？\n怎么了，受伤了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "902955506c5a6cc0397eb1693f78f866c84066578d44b1456a5c6e5c3d3183c8", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　驚かせちゃって\nすみません。今、涙を流す練習をしてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！吓到你了，真对不起。我刚才正在练习流眼泪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "45ecf700e31fdeef614c164ac9df089919632b4477f027abbd14866a327155fb", "ja": "でも、思うように涙が出てくれなくて……。\nそれで、タマネギを切ってコツをつかんでました。", "zh": "可是，眼泪就是没法如愿流出来……  \n所以我就切洋葱来掌握诀窍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fff6efb3e5bd6efcb011bcb9a1af1077c5b06cc3af9441acb1e9045057713d04", "ja": "涙を流す練習？　……もしかして、\n『待ちぼうけのLacrima』を歌うために？", "zh": "练习流泪？……难道是为了唱《待ちぼうけのLacrima》？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "f84254f300f02d486e8728e90e5f9f8ee59c015661067fab5276fe8e239a60ab", "ja": "はい！　すごく切ない歌なので、涙を流したら\n素敵なんじゃないかなって……", "zh": "是的！因为是首非常感伤的歌，我就在想，要是能流下眼泪的话，应该会很棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "7cbd786e4e37b2603239ce5b0db98d0bd237b819a883f90f570c80e12ffe1721", "ja": "でもやっぱり、練習はやめておきますね。\n涙は、無理に流すものじゃありませんし……。", "zh": "不过，我还是不练习了。\n眼泪这种东西，不能勉强自己流出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "db9628ce797a4d4312acc22a49aadd8167b26f97471587b00aeef1da8126caa9", "ja": "それに、歌いながらタマネギは切れませんしね。\nふふっ！", "zh": "而且，也没法一边唱歌一边切洋葱嘛。\n呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d4a134ee8c30b0825ab617e3e7d59d7b9afe7490ed787f55902a9d7edfb4007d", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。それに、無理に涙を流さなくても、\n心を込めて歌えばファンの人達の心には届くはずだよ。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。而且，就算不勉强自己流泪，只要用心歌唱，应该也能传达到粉丝们的心中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "9dccdd9c0e3e5cbcb092e8b3b8799106532690a33c21caf93804c9dbbb122570", "ja": "そうですよね！　……あっ、そうだ。\n{$P$}に、お願いがあったんです。", "zh": "是啊！……啊，对了。  \n我有件事想拜托{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "b0f3e00a2e86b860775bbf68ba68800c8aee8645b74b813dd5304396f9a19231", "ja": "今から、私の頭をなでてもらえませんか？", "zh": "现在，可以请您摸摸我的头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1012_p", "source_sha256": "011c272ee6aee9ee071807b78a7610420c1a85cadbd1d687f64d2c762f8da0d8", "ja": "紗代子の頭を……なでる？", "zh": "摸紗代子的头……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "7ee5974c0041e46ce98a7531a50702d9cf92cf14733c7f4524e67a5746e62068", "ja": "はい！　歌詞の中に、そういう\nシチュエーションが出てきますよね？", "zh": "是的！歌词中会出现那样的情境，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "a370e8169f0f9e99bc757556246f27e5187ccea354d75be4315917fa90e5050a", "ja": "でも私、頭をなでてもらってうれしいっていう感覚が、\nよくわからなくて……それで……。", "zh": "可是，我不太明白被摸头会感到开心是什么感觉……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "1199e6a6aaaf17b9199acf2477b285f87e68feee42b32a9bfc0db5f6b55b3435", "ja": "他に、頼める人もいませんし……。\nえっと……ダメ、ですか……？", "zh": "另外，也没有其他可以拜托的人了……  \n那个……不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ce216ecd8627af82b0e8f4e118c18a120c05a1c674f9529aba6e2eb37c94f020", "ja": "いや。そういう事なら、喜んで協力するよ。", "zh": "没有的事。既然是这样，我很乐意协助你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_1017", "source_sha256": "327b7f62b0b20942713e6bb3d441751ef13c739b4ba307dff4df4fd059f9add2", "ja": "撫でる", "zh": "抚摸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1f7b1f22fed679acd968929ea418bbf991242116960f81ec01b98c5e59a178d5", "ja": "はい。こんな感じで、どうかな？", "zh": "嗯。像这样，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "24b02f24e4d0d4ee8a1b63af6ad4bb5912b33750618ce4290d6aad2216a988a4", "ja": "ぐすっ……。あ、あれ？", "zh": "呜呜……啊，咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2002_p", "source_sha256": "7c737c3bfbaefc5d4df860141fe428b4da99d17b1fe830bb22eb565fc8884325", "ja": "さ、紗代子？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "紗、纱代子？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "378541f13a210d09d8b947612b477a7577ad39521419a65646faa8e82f76b44e", "ja": "わ、わかりません……！　{$P$}に\n頭をなでてもらったら、なんだか急に、涙が……。", "zh": "我、我也不知道……！被{$P$}\n摸了摸头之后，不知怎么突然就掉眼泪了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2004_027say", "source_sha256": "194f2a6da2cbd4a92ff41a601715fae125396adf04e93e481dbcda2fd0e9dd17", "ja": "あっ……あの、ご協力ありがとうございました！\n歌詞の意味、なんとなくわかった気がします！", "zh": "啊……那个，非常感谢您的协助！\n我好像大概明白歌词的意思了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0153_2005_027say", "source_sha256": "f09fb8093367ddbfecc0863aad080de2107f12f096b1082ac9006d587a7d104d", "ja": "お茶、すぐに淹れますから！\n{$P$}、待っててくださいね！", "zh": "我马上泡茶！\n{$P$}，请等一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
